          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We currently ship to Europe, Australia and North America.</p><p>Orders are processed within 1-3 business days. Please note that this does not include weekends or public holidays.</p><p><strong>Delivery Times</strong></p><ul><li>France: 2-5 business days</li><li>Europe: 5-10 business days</li><li>North America: 10-15 business days</li></ul><p>Please note that delivery times may vary during peak seasons or due to unforeseen circumstances.</p><p><strong>Shipping Costs</strong></p><ul><li>Standard Shipping: 5,99 $ (free for orders over 35 $).</li><li>Express Shipping: 12,99 $.</li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Tracking Information</strong><br/>Once your order has been shipped, you’ll receive a confirmation email with a tracking number to monitor your shipment.</p>",
