        "text_TXHhhp": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We want you to love your Zephyra experience. If something isn’t quite right, we’re here to make it easy:</p><ul><li><strong>Eligible Returns:</strong> Products must be unused, in their original condition, and packaging.</li><li><strong>Return Window:</strong> Returns can be initiated within 30 days of receiving your order.</li><li><strong>Shipping Costs:</strong> Return shipping costs are covered by the customer unless the issue is related to product quality.</li></ul><p>Our goal is to ensure your satisfaction while keeping the process simple and clear. For any questions or assistance, reach out to us at <a><strong>hello@zephyra.com</strong></a>.</p>",
